ne-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607102346378409_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260710/202607102346378409_720.jpg"> </div><p>【世界杯战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/match1867450date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">晋级半决赛！西班牙2-1比利时将战法国 梅里诺替补绝杀拉门斯送礼</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260711/zhanbao_image_1867450_1783716905_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260711/zhanbao_image_1867450_1783716905_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260711/zhanbao_image_1867450_1783716905_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>西班牙2-1战胜比利时，将在半决赛对阵法国。梅里诺再次替补绝杀，法比安、德凯特拉雷破门。</p><p>【世界杯相关】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a51147f4e6b8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">斗牛士归来！西班牙时隔16年再进世界杯半决赛，队史第三次进4强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a5163f0d36cf.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a5163f0d36cf.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a5163f0d36cf.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/4决赛，西班牙战胜比利时，晋级半决赛，时隔16年再度进入四强。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a511fecbc5b5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">强强对话！世界杯半决赛：法国vs西班牙，亚马尔再对决姆巴佩</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a515f22ef990.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a515f22ef990.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a515f22ef990.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙半决赛将对阵法国，北京时间7月15日3点开球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a51300e256f6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">止步8强！比利时黄金一代落幕 35岁丁丁、34岁裤袜、33岁卢卡库..</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a5164a3eff14.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a5164a3eff14.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a5164a3eff14.jpg"> </div><p>本届世界杯出局后，比利时的“黄金一代”球员们似乎已经迎来了自己国家队生涯的落幕。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a515b2941877native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">神级替补梅超锋！梅里诺替补6分钟绝杀葡萄牙，2分钟绝杀比利时！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a515e392ec16.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a515e392ec16.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a515e392ec16.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/4决赛，西班牙2-1战胜比利时，晋级四强。本场比赛梅里诺替补登场2分钟上演绝杀，连续两场替补绝杀！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a516596aa565native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅里诺2年前绝杀德国送别克罗斯 本届绝杀葡比送别C罗、德布劳内</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a517661133fd_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a517661133fd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/6a517661133fd.jpg"> </div><p>梅里诺大概率已经终结了德布劳内、库尔图瓦等人最后的世界杯夺冠希望。梅里诺上一场绝杀葡萄牙送别C罗，2年前的1/4决赛，仍然是梅里诺绝杀，西班牙淘汰德国，克罗斯就此退役。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a5165f77e14enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">亚马尔：我不怕法国队，该害怕的应该是他们，之前就被我们淘汰过</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/202607110605568281.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/202607110605568281.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/202607110605568281.jpg"> </div><p>赛后西班牙前锋亚马尔接受采访，总结了本场比赛，并展望了对阵法国的半决赛。他放话，下场对决该怕的可不是他们。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a516a233fd62native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">裤袜：我无法开大脚，教练说不是100%状态就换人 不该怪罪拉门斯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.44" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a4583570fc9f_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.44" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.44" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a4583570fc9f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a4583570fc9f.jpg"> </div><p>赛后库尔图瓦接受采访，谈到受伤和登场的拉门斯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a516bbcb0baanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">库尔图瓦：想休息一年再回国家队，比利时不接受的话就到此为止了</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a4583523b1e5_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a4583523b1e5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260702/6a4583523b1e5.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯1/4决赛，比利时1-2西班牙止步八强。赛后库尔图瓦接受采访时，表示自己想在国家队“休息一下”。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a51638048440native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">比利时主帅：裤袜丁丁都无法坚持太不幸，很遗憾年轻球员犯了错</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a516d3cc4d24native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">鲁迪·加西亚：换丁丁和裤袜不在计划之中 罗德里手球应该判点球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.81" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/202607110526383809.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.81" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.81" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/202607110526383809.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/202607110526383809.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯1/4决赛，比利时1-2负于西班牙，无缘四强。赛后比利时主帅鲁迪·加西亚接受了采访。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a516149dd3a0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">还剩6队！OPTA夺冠概率：法国33.71% 西班牙27.25% 阿根廷15.61%</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/202607110518471840_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/202607110518471840_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260711/202607110518471840_1280.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙淘汰比利时晋级四强，半决赛将对阵法国。至此，本届世界杯还剩最后6支球队，最新夺冠概率出炉。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-11/6a512d4a73830native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">4场3球2助！瑞士主帅赛前发布会确认：曼赞比因伤无缘出战阿根廷</a></p><div class="img_wrap" d